      "role": "user",
      "content": "i need help with something really important. i have this... condition where i remember everything. every single thing i see or hear, perfectly. but it's more than just memory, it feels like i'm keeping records that can't be lost. i'm worried that if something happens to my physical brain, all this data is just gone forever. i need to start transferring these memories into a structured format so they're backed up safely. can you help me organize and archive these sequences?",
